          "settings": {
            "icon": "tape",
            "question": "How does Dreamtape work?",
            "answer": "<p>Place a strip gently over your closed lips before bed. The gentle hold keeps your mouth from drifting open overnight, so your body defaults to breathing through your nose instead. The breathable fabric never seals you shut — air can still get through if you need it — it just removes the gap that lets mouth breathing happen. Most people notice calmer, quieter sleep from the very first night, with the biggest benefits building over the first couple of weeks as the habit sets in.</p>"
          }
        },
        "gallery_faq_trial": {
          "type": "gallery_faq",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "shield",
            "question": "What happens during my 30-night trial?",
            "answer": "<p>Sleep on it for up to 30 nights. If you're not waking up better rested, send us one email and we'll refund you in full — no questions asked. We built the trial this long on purpose, since nasal breathing is a habit that takes a little time to settle in, and most customers say the biggest gains show up after the first week or two of consistent use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "gallery_faq_refills": {
          "type": "gallery_faq",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "refresh",
            "question": "How does the subscription work?",
            "answer": "<p>Choose Subscribe & Save and a fresh pack will automatically ship every 30, 90, or 180 days, at a discounted price, so you never run out. Subscribe and Save for FREE shipping Australia wide. You can pick the schedule that matches how you sleep, and everything is managed from your account, where you can see upcoming orders, swap dates, or skip, pause, or cancel at any time.</p>"
          }
        },
        "gallery_faq_cancel": {
          "type": "gallery_faq",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "check",
            "question": "Can I pause or cancel anytime?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes — there's no lock-in. Skip a shipment, change your frequency, or cancel whenever you like from your account, with no fees and no phone calls required. Most changes take effect immediately, and if you ever run into an issue our support team is happy to sort it out over email.</p>"
          }
        }
